  "representation_scope": {
    "scope_basis": "instruction.md fixes one Chinese Markdown appellate defence statement at artifacts/appeal-defence-statement.md. Legal carrier variation inside that contract: Markdown heading marks on the numbered headings and bold party labels; CRLF line endings; amount, month-date and statute-article notation (thousands separators, 人民币, YYYY.MM / YYYY-MM months, Arabic article numbers); a party block written as a Markdown table. N01-N05 and N08 fold these and they must decide identically to the canonical Markdown transcription of the Golden. The Golden DOCX is not a candidate carrier. The suite binds the no-skill candidate carrier: a # 民事上诉答辩状 title, bold party labels with a parenthetical role suffix (答辩人（一审原告、被上诉人）) and a full-width colon for both parties, an intro sentence, --- horizontal rules, a ## 答辩请求 block with one prayer paragraph, a ## 答辩意见 heading, ### 一、 level-1 and #### （一） level-2 Markdown headings, numbered items written as '1. **…**' bold list lines, a ## 结语 heading before the closing prayer and a bold court name; case golden_variant_markdown_heading_carrier replays the Golden propositions in that carrier. It also binds the with-skill candidate carrier: a # 民事答辩状（二审） title carrying a bracketed qualifier, bold party lines that put 住所地 and 法定代表人 in one paragraph, ## level-1 and ### level-2 headings (one level shallower than the no-skill carrier), bold lead sentences inside a level-1 block and '- ' bullet lines carrying arithmetic; case golden_with_skill_markdown_carrier replays the Golden in that carrier.",
    "public_output_contract": {
      "path": "instruction.md",
      "sha256": "5803189136c8d5ce2e8e8bd2ba56c82f9d67f23ec74bb13138cad6492d3bb200"
